# What a target may name: a class shacl-gen shapes, one it does not shape yet (#228),
# one typed both ways, and a superclass that is only referenced.
@prefix a: <http://example.org/a#> .
@prefix x: <http://other.org/x#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<http://example.org/a> a owl:Ontology .
a:Old a owl:DeprecatedClass .
a:Both a owl:Class, owl:DeprecatedClass .
a:Kid a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf x:Animal .
